---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { BUSINESS_NAME, OWNER_NAME, LOCATION, INSTAGRAM_URL, INSTAGRAM_HANDLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About — The Glitzy Farmhouse"
			description={`Meet ${OWNER_NAME}, the artisan behind The Glitzy Farmhouse's handmade wreaths and seasonal decor in ${LOCATION}.`}
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="section about-hero">
				<div class="wrap">
					<img src="/logo.jpg" alt={`${BUSINESS_NAME} logo`} class="about-logo" width="1000" height="667" />
					<span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
					<h1>About The <em class="script">Glitzy</em> Farmhouse</h1>
					<p class="lede">Handmade, one wreath at a time, right here in {LOCATION}.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section">
				<div class="wrap prose-wrap">
					<h2>Meet {OWNER_NAME}</h2>
					<p>
						The Glitzy Farmhouse is a small, local, artisan-run business creating custom
						handmade designer wreaths and seasonal home decor. Every piece starts the same
						way — a color scheme, an idea, or just a favorite season — and is built entirely
						by hand from there.
					</p>
					<p>
						There's no assembly line here. Ribbon is chosen and shaped, florals are arranged,
						and every bow is tied by hand until a piece feels finished. That's what makes each
						wreath one-of-a-kind: it's made for the person who ordered it, not pulled off a shelf.
					</p>
					<h3>Rooted in the Dothan community</h3>
					<p>
						Being local matters. The Glitzy Farmhouse is a proud contributor to community
						fundraisers and charity raffles around Dothan and the Wiregrass — including "Help a
						Hero" giveaways supporting local veterans and first responders, often in partnership
						with area businesses. Supporting neighbors is just as much a part of this business as
						the wreaths themselves.
					</p>
					<h3>How custom orders work</h3>
					<p>
						Every custom piece is made to order. The best way to start is a quick message with
						your color palette or inspiration, where the piece will hang, and your timeline —
						from there, expect a few design options and a price before anything is built.
					</p>
					<a class="btn btn-primary" href={INSTAGRAM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						Start a Custom Order on Instagram
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
<style>
	.about-hero {
		background: var(--cream-deep);
		text-align: center;
		padding-bottom: 3em;
	}
	.about-hero .wrap {
		max-width: 640px;
	}
	.about-logo {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 320px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.75em auto;
		border-radius: 16px;
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
	}
	.about-hero h1 {
		margin-top: 0.2em;
	}
	.lede {
		font-size: 1.1em;
	}
	.prose-wrap {
		max-width: 720px;
	}
	.prose-wrap .btn {
		margin-top: 1em;
	}
</style>
